WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.766
What is Sahaja Yoga, this all of you, most of you know.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.200
Intellectually, everyone knows

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.533
but even now, we haven't been able to understand

00:00:20.975 --> 00:00:24.374
whether it's identification with us is complete or not.

00:00:26.299 --> 00:00:31.632
So what has happened that you started feeling
vibrations in your hands?

00:00:32.849 --> 00:00:34.015
What is it?

00:00:35.715 --> 00:00:38.715
I have told you many times that this is the light
of the Spirit.

00:00:40.098 --> 00:00:41.990
Now the Spirit has started speaking.

00:00:42.532 --> 00:00:48.590
Until now, the Spirit was silent. It had no voice.

00:00:49.757 --> 00:00:51.182
It didn't convey anything.

00:00:52.365 --> 00:00:57.582
The Spirit residing within as a witness

00:00:58.274 --> 00:01:00.890
observed everything; It watched all your actions
and behavior.

00:01:04.673 --> 00:01:10.448
After awakening when the Kundalini emerged from
the Sahastrara,

00:01:11.273 --> 00:01:14.848
then realization of the Self took place.

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:19.698
The Spirit was realized, means what?

00:01:20.498 --> 00:01:24.481
That the conversation with the Spirit started –
the Spirit started speaking.

00:01:25.939 --> 00:01:28.673
It speaks through vibrations.

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:32.657
As long as your motor vehicle is stationary,

00:01:33.057 --> 00:01:36.673
till then there is no movement inside, and
nothing can be heard.

00:01:37.406 --> 00:01:40.890
As soon as the motor started, it starts making
a 'jhak-jhak-jhak-jhak' sound.

00:01:41.757 --> 00:01:45.215
It is such a simple thing, understand that
within you,

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:53.156
your Spirit, your dynamo is active, it has
started working.

00:01:54.548 --> 00:01:57.548
You can know the Truth only through the Spirit;

00:01:57.981 --> 00:02:00.731
And you can know the Almighty, too, through
the Spirit.

00:02:01.706 --> 00:02:06.073
The worldly things through your sight,

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:10.398
through your eyes, nose, ears, through
everything can be known.

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:15.665
But to know the Supreme Being, the awakening
of the Spirit is necessary.

00:02:16.315 --> 00:02:20.265
Prior to that, whatever we talk about God
is all useless.

00:02:22.415 --> 00:02:25.848
Because even believing in it becomes a form
of blindness.

00:02:27.106 --> 00:02:30.006
All people say that this person has become God,

00:02:30.264 --> 00:02:34.289
that person has become, he has done these auspicious
deeds and has incarnated in this world.

00:02:34.764 --> 00:02:39.364
Such things are unbelievable, especially in these
modern times.

00:02:39.764 --> 00:02:44.956
Whereas we consider a machine to be a very big
thing, we consider Science to be a very big thing,

00:02:48.389 --> 00:02:53.356
when your Spirit awakens, a new science of the
Self begins.

00:02:54.389 --> 00:02:58.423
No matter how much is said about it now, it is
not credible.

00:02:59.581 --> 00:03:02.431
You cannot know it, you cannot see it,

00:03:02.631 --> 00:03:06.239
You cannot sense this; you cannot feel this.

00:03:06.572 --> 00:03:11.022
What is there to say about it? That is why Kabir
described it as 'the jaggery tasted by a dumb person'.

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:18.780
But even then the simile does not fit properly because

00:03:19.772 --> 00:03:24.863
the 'dumb man's jaggery' is something that only the person
eating it and the one who understands it can truly grasp.

00:03:25.555 --> 00:03:29.730
That person is considered superior to a dumb person.

00:03:31.122 --> 00:03:38.280
But it is not like that. It is such that a new
consciousness,

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:45.479
a subtle stream of a new consciousness begins to
flow within you, flowing from your Spirit.

00:03:47.071 --> 00:03:51.004
Up to now anything you look at, there is always
a possibility of illusion.

00:03:52.246 --> 00:03:54.629
That, like this thing, you said it's a white saree.

00:03:56.196 --> 00:04:00.437
Someone will say, "Yes, it was white but it
might have some stains on it."

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:08.012
It is not a sure thing. Nothing can be certain
until the Spirit provides the answer.

00:04:09.071 --> 00:04:13.003
Does God exist or not? Someone might say,
"Yes, indeed—I have complete faith in God."

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:18.503
"How?" "I was on my way when something went
wrong up ahead."

00:04:18.703 --> 00:04:22.903
"So I said to God, 'Please heal me, save me from this.'

00:04:23.086 --> 00:04:26.878
"I was saved; just see if God exists or not."
This is not a matter of faith.

00:04:27.619 --> 00:04:32.353
This could be a coincidence—just an incidence; it’s not
really a matter of faith.

00:04:32.961 --> 00:04:37.245
"We suffered a financial loss, so we went to Hanuman-ji,"

00:04:37.462 --> 00:04:42.262
"We offered Him a sum of one-and-a-quarter rupees
—we had a profit."

00:04:42.945 --> 00:04:46.337
This, too, is not the work of the Divine; nor is
it a matter to have faith.

00:04:48.362 --> 00:04:53.479
Or ask someone, "What happened?" "I was passing
by, and suddenly, from over there"

00:04:54.096 --> 00:04:57.046
"A man came, recognized me, and said to me,"

00:04:57.088 --> 00:05:01.937
"Look, I have understood what is on your mind; if you
do such-and-such, then things will work out for you."

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:08.653
Someone said, "I was in deep trouble, and an astrologer
came along..."

00:05:08.819 --> 00:05:12.545
"And told me, 'Look, this is the treatment for it';
I followed it and got well."

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:15.162
All these are not the works of God.

00:05:16.637 --> 00:05:20.029
And if you take some reference of God on
this matter

00:05:20.112 --> 00:05:24.437
and think about the Divine, you do a great
injustice to the Divine as well.

00:05:25.754 --> 00:05:30.562
To understand the Almighty Supreme God, one must
first know one's own power.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:34.320
He who possesses power more intense than
that of the Sun,

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:38.445
to see Him, one must first awaken the Sun
of the Spirit within.

00:05:38.995 --> 00:05:41.670
Without it, you cannot know that Power.

00:05:41.795 --> 00:05:45.495
And neither can you propagate(spread) it;
it cannot be conveyed.

00:05:46.503 --> 00:05:48.020
That great, tremendous power!

00:05:49.795 --> 00:05:55.478
When a human being wants to endure something
that is so intense

00:05:56.386 --> 00:06:00.553
he should also consider whether his power has
been awakened or not.

00:06:01.986 --> 00:06:08.619
Then it's also this thing that we think we will
awaken it, that we will attain the Divine.

00:06:09.811 --> 00:06:14.869
You do not find God; God finds you.

00:06:15.644 --> 00:06:19.577
It is just like a sea saying, "I will
find the ocean" — no.

00:06:20.494 --> 00:06:23.794
The ocean only will fall upon you and it
itself will find you.

00:06:24.286 --> 00:06:27.919
Just make yourself worthy enough for it to find you.

00:06:31.669 --> 00:06:35.977
The biggest question before man is how can the
Spirit be awakened.

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:39.360
How can the Spirit be awakened, so that all
this may be known?

00:06:40.427 --> 00:06:43.768
That question is now gone through Sahaja Yoga.

00:06:44.301 --> 00:06:47.085
Through Sahaja Yoga, the awakening of your Spirit
should take place.

00:06:47.393 --> 00:06:49.718
That won't be achieved through mere thinking.

00:06:49.826 --> 00:06:53.793
Someone might say, "I have read so many books."
By reading books it won't happen.

00:06:55.051 --> 00:07:00.751
'We gave it so much thought, and Mataji, we think
so much, and why didn't it happen to us?'

00:07:01.409 --> 00:07:04.409
Child, you cannot attain anything through
thought alone.

00:07:04.684 --> 00:07:08.534
Human thought is limited – I am talking about
the Infinite.

00:07:09.051 --> 00:07:13.459
To reach the Infinite, you must also

00:07:15.184 --> 00:07:17.917
achieve the source of the Infinite within you
- the Spirit.

00:07:20.275 --> 00:07:24.775
With the eyes, with the nose, with the mouth, with
the hands, with the intellect,

00:07:24.908 --> 00:07:28.783
or through any other thing, you cannot know
the Supreme Spirit.

00:07:29.041 --> 00:07:33.333
You can know It only through the Spirit, and only
then do you find contentment through it.

00:07:34.441 --> 00:07:37.691
And the satisfaction of Sahaja Yoga is also the
satisfaction of the Spirit.

00:07:38.824 --> 00:07:41.408
This is another thing we need to know.

00:07:41.866 --> 00:07:45.416
It's satisfaction is not merely in our physical
self getting well—

00:07:45.816 --> 00:07:51.666
It does happen, that's a different matter. All of you have
attained good health, and your worldly attachments have
been broken.

00:07:51.899 --> 00:07:56.316
A lot of good things have happened, turned out well -
everything, it's just as a form of blessing.

00:07:57.733 --> 00:08:03.116
But the satisfaction and joy of the Spirit, comes
from the Spirit itself.

00:08:03.916 --> 00:08:06.916
The Spirit finds contentment only with the
Spirit itself.

00:08:09.099 --> 00:08:15.533
Unless your own Spirit is awakened, you cannot truly
experience the joy of another awakened Spirit.

00:08:16.983 --> 00:08:22.933
Whatever joy, whatever joy arises from thoughts
—whatever people perceive as joy...

00:08:23.075 --> 00:08:25.833
that is not bliss; it is a fleeting sense of pleasure.

00:08:27.008 --> 00:08:30.008
Bliss is something else entirely.

00:08:31.316 --> 00:08:37.108
Joy is neither happiness nor sorrow, but it is
in between a very peaceful attention(mind).

00:08:40.391 --> 00:08:43.391
Neither is it emotion nor is it thought.

00:08:44.433 --> 00:08:48.274
Because when you are beyond thoughts

00:08:48.999 --> 00:08:54.149
then what flows within you—a sort of a source
flows within,

00:08:54.532 --> 00:08:59.516
and which to the whole body, and the complete mind,
intellect,

00:08:59.924 --> 00:09:05.066
ego etc, fills everything with a thrill of delight -
that singular joy

00:09:05.658 --> 00:09:08.499
and that thing—whosoever talks about it...

00:09:10.074 --> 00:09:15.541
how can you possibly understand it unless that
very thing flows within you?

00:09:17.008 --> 00:09:21.091
Unless you have experienced the joy

00:09:21.866 --> 00:09:24.866
how can anyone make you understand through
conversation alone?

00:09:27.066 --> 00:09:30.591
In order to assess that joy within,

00:09:31.591 --> 00:09:35.208
to feel it within, what you have within -

00:09:35.533 --> 00:09:38.883
the flame of the Spirit; until it is lit,

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:43.333
you will remain completely unaware of it.

00:09:43.475 --> 00:09:47.383
You cannot know It, you may think anything about It,

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:51.400
understand It, satisfy your mind - but that
is a lie, not the truth.

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:57.950
Through Sahaja Yoga, your Spirit becomes awakened.

00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:04.417
Now the second stage begins - that is the light
of the Spirit and our darkness.

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:09.767
When that light starts increasing, people see that
there is darkness in their surroundings,

00:10:10.442 --> 00:10:15.925
there is darkness all around. This darkness is
suppressing the light of the Spirit.

00:10:18.175 --> 00:10:19.883
Direct your attention towards the Spirit.

00:10:21.341 --> 00:10:24.958
There are many ways to get away from darkness.

00:10:25.425 --> 00:10:31.741
When there was darkness in this room, we used
to think that darkness alone was the Truth.

00:10:32.391 --> 00:10:37.624
We had taken that for the Truth—it's darkness.
Frightened by it, we were making our way inside,
holding hands.

00:10:38.099 --> 00:10:42.849
When light appeared here, we realized that the
darkness which had existed was an illusion.

00:10:43.774 --> 00:10:50.524
All of that is illusory. When the light dawns,
all the affairs of this world seem illusory.

00:10:51.841 --> 00:10:57.449
In the darkness people see that there are ghosts
here, there are demons here, there are spirits
here, this is here.

00:10:58.132 --> 00:11:02.957
When there is light, nothing else is visible
except the Almighty.

00:11:03.507 --> 00:11:05.249
Nothing except Brahma.

00:11:05.657 --> 00:11:09.273
Brahma means, this very thing that is flowing
from within you, this is the truth of Brahma.

00:11:09.465 --> 00:11:12.140
It is the power of the Divine that is flowing
from within you.

00:11:12.598 --> 00:11:18.232
This very power does all the work and man does
not do any work – this is the Truth.

00:11:18.799 --> 00:11:23.124
But merely by saying—and I have absolute faith
in the Supreme Being—

00:11:23.249 --> 00:11:27.482
Nothing happens by doing this. You shouldn't
keep yourself in the dark.

00:11:28.015 --> 00:11:33.624
One should not deceive oneself. What use would
it be in cheating yourself?

00:11:36.032 --> 00:11:40.066
What is to be gained by saying, "We have
become great saints"?

00:11:40.349 --> 00:11:44.533
Only by attaining what is real, will one achieve the
true reality within.

00:11:44.916 --> 00:11:47.916
What satisfaction are you going to get from a fake thing?

00:11:51.058 --> 00:11:55.916
Therefore, you have made significant progress in
Sahaja Yoga. There is no doubt about it.

00:11:56.366 --> 00:12:00.666
These girls have come with me. Yes, they are
born realized.

00:12:00.949 --> 00:12:04.966
They possess the light of the Spirit within
themselves. They are in their own joy.

00:12:08.224 --> 00:12:12.808
And all those who attained this have spoken
of the Spirit,

00:12:12.916 --> 00:12:15.783
spoke of the Divine—but no one understood them.

00:12:16.316 --> 00:12:22.816
They stoned them, crucified them, poisoned them,
and persecuted them severely.

00:12:23.466 --> 00:12:27.908
You ought to face a little hardship too;
otherwise, how will you understand?

00:12:28.575 --> 00:12:33.550
But when a person starts enjoying the joy of
the Spirit, like

00:12:34.325 --> 00:12:38.283
that a man is generous, that he's the Spirit,
he gives; take it, plunder it.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:43.691
Take as much as you want. Fill yourself up with
it. How much do you need? The more you plunder,
the greater the joy.

00:12:44.333 --> 00:12:51.258
A man is a miser. He thoroughly enjoys his stinginess.

00:12:51.766 --> 00:12:54.658
"This money I saved, I saved money there."

00:12:54.933 --> 00:12:58.517
Some person who cheats people would think,
'Well, I have taken away so much money from him.'

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:03.734
Now, the man who thinks of stinginess...

00:13:04.192 --> 00:13:07.192
that, 'Well, I've done a great, I have done this work.'

00:13:07.434 --> 00:13:11.084
Suppose someone has a vice—one who has a weakness
for women.

00:13:11.526 --> 00:13:14.917
He says, "Well, I've trapped this woman, I've
trapped that one too."

00:13:15.042 --> 00:13:20.267
He's swindled money from this one and that one
too; settled this one too—he enjoys that.

00:13:21.642 --> 00:13:27.808
You see, is this really something worth enjoying
in the world? Everything is so momentary.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:32.725
'I won this, I slammed him down, I beat him.'

00:13:33.042 --> 00:13:38.692
Now let's look at another thing to enjoy,
that I've given away this

00:13:38.692 --> 00:13:44.275
What’s gone, let it go. What's called the
joy of generosity—oh, just give.

00:13:45.767 --> 00:13:50.875
Not of taking but giving. This comes from the
Spirit. Everything else is the opposite of this.

00:13:51.783 --> 00:13:53.575
Enjoy giving.

00:13:54.817 --> 00:13:59.308
Relish the joy of love—that "I gave love to
this one, I gave love to that one."

00:14:00.883 --> 00:14:05.125
Enjoy loving. Many people have a sense of
self-importance, that 'I'—

00:14:05.125 --> 00:14:08.342
Ah, ha, ha! 'I have this,' 'I'

00:14:09.742 --> 00:14:13.334
Where 'You are' will take the place of 'I'—

00:14:14.742 --> 00:14:17.593
Savor the experience—see what unfolds; a
person just keeps becoming humbler.

00:14:17.709 --> 00:14:20.976
Ah-ha-ha-ha, what fun it is, in being humble
and also in this dissolution.

00:14:22.201 --> 00:14:26.918
These are the joys of the Spirit; collect them.
There are many such small-small joys of the Spirit.

00:14:31.285 --> 00:14:36.918
We don't know how to collect the bliss of the
Spirit because the Spirit within us is not
yet awakened.

00:14:37.093 --> 00:14:42.468
But even if the Spirit is awakened, we fail to
gather them, what will people say about us?

00:14:47.543 --> 00:14:49.118
What are we collecting?

00:14:50.068 --> 00:14:54.385
In Sahaja Yoga, many people here have been coming
for six or seven years—they have been coming
for six years.

00:14:54.877 --> 00:14:58.118
Did we gather the joy of the Spirit?

00:14:59.443 --> 00:15:03.701
We recently had a very big program in London
and a lot of people came there.

00:15:04.526 --> 00:15:08.434
But there is a gentleman there who helps us a lot.

00:15:09.567 --> 00:15:12.084
I really liked one thing about him, found
it very interesting.

00:15:12.676 --> 00:15:16.776
It was night time and quite late; there wasn't
even enough space in his house—it was too crowded.

00:15:17.318 --> 00:15:20.343
And everyone was sitting there. Then I said,
"Alright, let's go home now."

00:15:20.543 --> 00:15:23.676
Everyone else - and I went upstairs, thinking
that everyone would leave.

00:15:23.901 --> 00:15:28.134
When they had left, the next day he looked a
bit dejected. I asked, "What happened?"

00:15:28.284 --> 00:15:33.634
He said, "Mother, I had cooked food for everyone;
why didn't You let them have it?"

00:15:33.876 --> 00:15:37.751
I was delighted, so happy that you can't
even imagine.

00:15:39.801 --> 00:15:44.818
He didn't weigh anything, didn't think about
how much money would be spent or not.

00:15:44.951 --> 00:15:48.376
We serve the saints with great deliberation.

00:15:49.151 --> 00:15:54.842
With great consideration and deliberation.
And God too, will serve you with the same
careful consideration.

00:15:57.167 --> 00:16:00.150
When you have to serve the saints, then you
do it after careful consideration

00:16:00.217 --> 00:16:03.625
and when you have to do for drunkards, then
spend a lot of money.

00:16:06.492 --> 00:16:12.867
When you are one with the Spirit, when you
have to weigh the joy of the Spirit, then
remain engaged in the service of the saints.

00:16:13.792 --> 00:16:17.792
Recognize the saints. Serve the devotees

00:16:18.459 --> 00:16:20.926
and flee from those who are not devotees.

00:16:22.034 --> 00:16:27.034
You have nothing to do with them; they are
of no concern to you.

00:16:30.684 --> 00:16:34.017
Because you are still gross; you associate
everything with grossness.

00:16:35.334 --> 00:16:38.659
You think, 'We have a relationship with them.'

00:16:38.834 --> 00:16:42.092
'Our money comes from them; our business
depends on them.'

00:16:42.184 --> 00:16:44.942
'This is because of them, so we should
do a lot for them.'

00:16:45.434 --> 00:16:48.084
And for the saints, we don't want to do it
for them.

00:16:51.784 --> 00:16:56.459
If a poor man is coming along and you wish
to serve him...

00:16:57.209 --> 00:17:02.217
We shouldn't do it simply because the other
person is poor; we should do it because,
deep down, we are poor too.

00:17:03.175 --> 00:17:07.800
Then we think, "No, sir, we are serving him;
we have served the poor."

00:17:07.884 --> 00:17:10.775
Such people can never attain God.

00:17:12.316 --> 00:17:14.875
Who are you to serve someone?

00:17:15.233 --> 00:17:20.850
There is immense ego within a human being.
He thinks, "I'm serving this person,
I'm serving that person."

00:17:22.133 --> 00:17:26.067
Service is such a thing that it flows. It's joyful.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:32.067
It flows on from eternity. How can I describe
the joy it brings?

00:17:33.384 --> 00:17:37.142
All these emotions keep flowing from within
Me at all times, every single moment.

00:17:41.217 --> 00:17:47.850
And when I see that you are deprived of it,
I feel deeply saddened.

00:17:49.383 --> 00:17:51.683
I wonder how these

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:58.475
waves of immense joy will begin to flow from
within you—share, do it, keep on giving.

00:18:01.025 --> 00:18:02.867
Is there any comparison(match) for that, too?

00:18:04.175 --> 00:18:08.159
We don't calculate when we receive, so why do
we sit and calculate so much when we give?

00:18:09.092 --> 00:18:14.001
Many people also say, "Mother, You do not see
anything, You keep on giving to everyone."

00:18:14.409 --> 00:18:16.251
Great saints and sages told Me this.

00:18:16.359 --> 00:18:21.318
Listening to it makes Me laugh—supposedly they
are holy men and sages, yet look at the kind
of calculation they are trying to make.

00:18:22.151 --> 00:18:24.618
Sadhus and saints don't know how to keep accounts.

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:29.618
We, too, should shape our lives in that way

00:18:30.718 --> 00:18:33.918
for which you have chosen yourself and
made your selection.

00:18:34.093 --> 00:18:38.485
You have chosen to enter the Kingdom of God.
You have chosen.

00:18:39.293 --> 00:18:43.410
I did not force you into this. You entered it
of your own accord.

00:18:43.893 --> 00:18:49.910
You found it within yourself, and you yourself
took your place in the Kingdom of God, becoming
its citizen.

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:57.627
After being seated in this new Kingdom, you yourself
should choose that for which you have come

00:19:02.302 --> 00:19:04.177
and the thing you want to achieve.

00:19:04.802 --> 00:19:08.135
But this time when I came from London

00:19:08.452 --> 00:19:14.927
seeing your faces brought Me great joy as
if roses have just bloomed,

00:19:16.044 --> 00:19:21.811
as if fragrance is flowing from within everyone.
Any gardener sees it this way,

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:25.744
one's own garden, then how pleased he is,
similarly I too felt very happy.

00:19:27.086 --> 00:19:32.961
In this very way, we must make gardens bloom
everywhere and fill every person's life with this.

00:19:33.661 --> 00:19:37.294
Now the thing is that Sahaja Yoga cannot grow
very fast.

00:19:38.136 --> 00:19:40.202
It has a reason because it is the Truth.

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:44.327
Humans don't take to Truth very easily. If
it's a drama,

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:49.727
or some wrestling, some show-off in it,

00:19:50.527 --> 00:19:54.235
if there is a cover of falsehood, then man
immediately accepts it.

00:19:54.677 --> 00:20:01.101
Otherwise, if the intellect starts working, a
person immediately takes to it; He does not
face any difficulty.

00:20:02.234 --> 00:20:06.701
But it becomes very difficult for him to
accept the Truth

00:20:06.943 --> 00:20:09.559
because he lives with falsehood all his life.

00:20:11.384 --> 00:20:16.701
And he does desire the Truth, but when the Truth
comes and stands right before him, he gets unnerved.

00:20:20.234 --> 00:20:21.984
Even then, one should think

00:20:22.784 --> 00:20:27.000
that there have never been as many Sahaja Yogis
in the world as there are today.

00:20:28.208 --> 00:20:33.050
You all speak the same language whether you
are in India or England,

00:20:33.092 --> 00:20:36.025
whether you're in America, in Finland,

00:20:36.325 --> 00:20:40.017
be it in Germany—people everywhere have now
become Self-realized.

00:20:40.667 --> 00:20:43.734
Many have become Self-realized—they are there
in every country.

00:20:43.951 --> 00:20:48.317
Everyone is understanding vibrations; terms like
'Swadhisthana Chakra' and the like are being
spoken in Sanskrit.

00:20:50.384 --> 00:20:53.959
Everyone is speaking your language; you are
speaking theirs too.

00:20:54.409 --> 00:20:59.392
In this, things like race, community, and the like
—these human-made distinctions—they do not work in it.

00:20:59.492 --> 00:21:02.700
The thread(system) made by God, that, "Your
Swadhishthan is catching,"

00:21:02.775 --> 00:21:06.692
whether you are English, or you are a Muslim,
or you are a Christian.

00:21:06.784 --> 00:21:10.917
It doesn't matter where you live; that has nothing
to do with it.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:16.259
Kundalini will certainly reveal the reality of things;
it will reveal the person you truly are.

00:21:16.401 --> 00:21:23.117
This is the Truth, and it has thousands of
enemies too—it is astonishing.

00:21:26.025 --> 00:21:29.217
But once you have realized that this is the Truth,
you should hold on fast to it.

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:34.851
I consider the one who latches on to be a true
seeker—saying, "Yes, this is the Truth I’ve found!"

00:21:35.359 --> 00:21:39.926
This very thing I found in London. In London, I
have deeply cherished this

00:21:43.026 --> 00:21:48.809
that the Sahaja Yogis of London, for one thing,
are very learned and educated.

00:21:49.601 --> 00:21:53.160
They are all into things like Kundalini—because
they are already on a quest.

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:58.543
They are seekers—extraordinarily dedicated seekers;
they are so exceptional that I cannot even
describe it to you.

00:22:00.235 --> 00:22:03.576
And in that seeking such is their state

00:22:04.376 --> 00:22:08.093
that they have reached that stage—they have
arrived at conclusions

00:22:08.285 --> 00:22:14.143
that, "This cannot be the Truth—this simply cannot be.
This Guru—he cannot be a real guru; he is a fraud."

00:22:14.668 --> 00:22:17.668
'This, too, cannot be the Truth; this, too, cannot be.'

00:22:17.726 --> 00:22:21.418
'Ya neti neti vachanai nigamo avochus' - This is not,

00:22:21.751 --> 00:22:24.751
this is not the Truth either, nor is that. Now
they arrived at what the Truth ought to be.

00:22:24.918 --> 00:22:27.009
And the moment they found it, grabbed it instantly.

00:22:29.042 --> 00:22:33.626
You will be surprised that here we couldn't give
awakening to the disciples of Mahesh Yogi etc.

00:22:33.643 --> 00:22:38.209
Their Kundalini has completely disappeared from such
people. One or two were given among all of them—

00:22:38.351 --> 00:22:41.351
You will remember - that too, poor guy fifty times,

00:22:41.926 --> 00:22:46.851
in Marathi is said (UNCLEAR) [MARATHI -'Kolanchha Marto']
- fifty times his

00:22:47.076 --> 00:22:51.018
condition deteriorated and he returned a number of
times, yet the Kundalini remained stuck right there.

00:22:51.218 --> 00:22:53.759
And these people cleaned it thoroughly.

00:22:55.585 --> 00:23:01.018
It was seen that those who spent ten-ten years
following Mahesh Yogi—how the Kundalini and the
Sahasrara opened up completely.

00:23:01.251 --> 00:23:04.234
It made Me so happy; I wondered where My children
had come from.

00:23:05.209 --> 00:23:07.126
Thoroughly cleaned, inside and out.

00:23:09.434 --> 00:23:12.309
But they no longer have any desire for money etc;
have had enough,

00:23:12.401 --> 00:23:15.159
"Our parents have endured all this filth;
we don't want it."

00:23:15.426 --> 00:23:17.359
They have left that aside and are busy with this.

00:23:18.018 --> 00:23:24.810
And when they had attained it - one better
than the other, I'm amazed such educated
scholars, it's astonishing.

00:23:26.226 --> 00:23:28.218
If you meet them, you will feel so happy.

00:23:28.793 --> 00:23:33.876
And all of them standing ready. My heart would swell
with pride, thinking, "Look, My children are standing,
one better than the other; what do I have to fear now?"

00:23:39.334 --> 00:23:43.659
Similarly you too, need to be like that, because
you possess a vast treasure.

00:23:44.259 --> 00:23:46.309
That is, you are born in this land of Yoga.

00:23:47.526 --> 00:23:50.876
Yours is a very great land of Yoga. Just recently,
when I was returning from London...

00:23:51.993 --> 00:23:56.343
Right upon arrival, I told him(My husband) that the
way to India has been touched, the boundary of India
has been reached.

00:23:56.568 --> 00:23:57.902
He asked, "How did You know?"

00:23:58.085 --> 00:24:02.969
I said, "You can't see it. Look down there—
all the vibrations are making a sound and
are rising up."

00:24:03.477 --> 00:24:07.302
There are vibrations in the entire atmosphere,
and are rising upwards from the Earth.

00:24:07.402 --> 00:24:10.677
They are throwing it all around like this.
I said, "This is My motherland, India."

00:24:11.794 --> 00:24:14.794
But just look at the state everyone has
brought it to.

00:24:17.169 --> 00:24:21.461
They are running after money, running after
power – should be ashamed.

00:24:21.561 --> 00:24:25.053
When will we talk about God in this land of Yoga?

00:24:25.870 --> 00:24:30.453
Now made [UNCLEAR - jazz?] here, make these filthy
things here, the hell in which those people

00:24:30.895 --> 00:24:33.603
are growing up, and the hell they want to escape from,

00:24:33.695 --> 00:24:37.811
that hell our own young people are busy creating
here—what fools.

00:24:40.320 --> 00:24:46.120
How are those people going to listen to us?
Those who are born in this land of Yoga

00:24:49.770 --> 00:24:54.412
[Aside – Keep your attention here; do not let your
mind wander] – Those who have been born in this
land of Yoga

00:24:56.179 --> 00:25:01.395
make use of its wealth, utilize it—the entire capital
is at your disposal.

00:25:02.003 --> 00:25:07.428
Our Earth is so huge and great, but the entire
Kundalini of the Earth is in

00:25:08.728 --> 00:25:11.104
this very land where you are standing.

00:25:11.554 --> 00:25:17.770
The moment I set foot on it, I feel the Mother Earth
pulling Me along rhythmically and tossing Me upwards.

00:25:23.553 --> 00:25:29.945
Worship It at all times and it must be understood
that for Indians especially,

00:25:30.561 --> 00:25:35.370
one must be especially prestigious because his
country has a prestige.

00:25:40.711 --> 00:25:45.220
Our pursuit for money and power has created
such a foolish

00:25:45.928 --> 00:25:49.987
atmosphere all around that I feel out of shame

00:25:51.204 --> 00:25:52.962
should sink into this very earth.

00:25:54.862 --> 00:25:57.453
Sahaja Yogis should stand firm in their dignity.

00:25:58.737 --> 00:26:04.412
Be prestigious yourself, stand tall in your
self-respect, because you are an Indian
and a Sahaja Yogi.

00:26:08.070 --> 00:26:13.820
These people, our Sahaja Yogis who are from
London, have so much respect for you,

00:26:14.245 --> 00:26:17.245
that they think if some Sahaja Yogi comes
from India

00:26:17.395 --> 00:26:19.861
"If even one of them comes, Mataji, we will all
be fine."

00:26:19.936 --> 00:26:24.203
I’m not calling anyone over, for fear that the
moment they see, they’ll exclaim, "Oh my God!"

00:26:24.586 --> 00:26:30.403
As soon as they arrive there, they’ll start doing
business; otherwise, they’ll look at someone’s palm
and say, "Come on, hand over five rupees."

00:26:32.753 --> 00:26:34.403
[MARATHI]

00:26:36.320 --> 00:26:40.136
You have no idea how much respect they have
for you all.

00:26:41.244 --> 00:26:47.461
And it is possible that a year or so from now,
we might hold an international seminar here.

00:26:48.253 --> 00:26:52.228
Until then, I would like you to devote a full
year entirely to Sahaja Yoga.

00:26:52.336 --> 00:26:56.169
Meditate every morning upon waking up—see, those
people wake up at four o'clock every morning.

00:26:57.977 --> 00:27:04.002
After bathing and cleaning up, they sit in
meditation and work on themselves.

00:27:06.460 --> 00:27:08.710
They go to sleep early in the evening;
don’t watch TV or anything like that.

00:27:08.810 --> 00:27:12.519
"We don't want to watch TV etc anything."
No cinemas, no to everything.

00:27:17.411 --> 00:27:20.344
They say, "What to do, our eyes are drawn
towards women."

00:27:20.394 --> 00:27:23.519
Some girls say, "Towards the men"; I said,
"Well, keep your eyes on Earth."

00:27:23.777 --> 00:27:26.011
So, they walk with their focus directed towards
the Earth itself.

00:27:26.394 --> 00:27:31.786
And if such a thing is said to our young boys here,
will these fools ever understand this?

00:27:32.086 --> 00:27:37.161
They just think that they should roam around
like movie heroes. Is this what is to be done
throughout life?

00:27:42.836 --> 00:27:47.811
And those are the people that you respect so
much – it's something to think about.

00:27:48.311 --> 00:27:50.928
Look, what illusion exists in the world!

00:27:52.111 --> 00:27:56.953
Till next year, I want you to put yourself at stake.

00:27:57.345 --> 00:28:02.495
I'm too with you at all times. Towards every person
I'm aware.

00:28:02.587 --> 00:28:07.144
But you people should also put yourselves at stake.
Put aside your personal matters,

00:28:09.094 --> 00:28:15.736
and descend into the Infinite, only then will
things work out.

00:28:18.811 --> 00:28:23.511
Unless this happens, the flag of Sahaja Yoga cannot
be unfurled.

00:28:23.637 --> 00:28:27.286
Nothing is going to happen because of Me. I have
come into this world many times.

00:28:27.619 --> 00:28:31.361
I have ventured into these pursuits many times,
but to no avail.

00:28:31.569 --> 00:28:34.211
Now it is up to you people only to do
whatever you want to do.

00:28:34.503 --> 00:28:38.686
I am behind you all the time, at all times.

00:28:41.878 --> 00:28:46.319
And I am very happy to have met you after so
many days, I'm so pleased.

00:28:46.902 --> 00:28:50.802
I wish, that when I come back after a year later,
My Sahaja Yogis -

00:28:51.494 --> 00:28:55.585
one better than the other - every person begins
to shine like a diamond.

00:28:55.835 --> 00:28:59.777
A diamond has to cut itself a little, has to watch itself.

00:29:00.644 --> 00:29:04.727
"O come on, you're muddling things here, come on,
let's just cut it."

00:29:05.094 --> 00:29:08.861
What's the harm, then the glow comes from within.
You just have to cut somewhat.

00:29:11.453 --> 00:29:16.161
With love a little bit—"Okay, you're heading this way now;
come along, come along, come along."

00:29:16.528 --> 00:29:22.219
It will keep getting carved. By shaping, such a beautiful
thing should be created that the world sees and marvels
at the creation.

00:29:22.727 --> 00:29:27.727
There is something special about it, too.
What a peculiar person he is! This has happened.

00:29:28.685 --> 00:29:33.569
Just now some gentleman was telling that a very
special person met someone -

00:29:35.477 --> 00:29:37.986
the people from Delhi had just come and were telling -

00:29:38.544 --> 00:29:43.286
So they said to Me, "We noticed a distinct radiance
on this man's face."

00:29:43.536 --> 00:29:48.003
I don't even remember him; So they said,
"Well, how are you so,"

00:29:48.353 --> 00:29:51.678
"How are you so miraculous? What's this
speciality about you?"

00:29:52.045 --> 00:29:58.186
He said, "You don't know, Mataji has given
me realization, I am a Sahaja Yogi."

00:29:59.369 --> 00:30:02.061
"Okay!" And he, too, was a Sahaja Yogi.

00:30:03.194 --> 00:30:06.978
He asked, "Where?" Started saying, "I had gone to
Delhi and got realization there; Since then,
I haven't had a glimpse of Mataji."

00:30:09.737 --> 00:30:14.828
And he is well-known in the whole society, and tells
everyone, "I am a Sahaja Yogi."

00:30:15.228 --> 00:30:20.536
"You know, Mataji has granted me self-realization,
and it is manifesting."

00:30:22.670 --> 00:30:27.270
It gives me great joy to hear this, too. One such
thing is heard from somewhere.

00:30:29.162 --> 00:30:31.762
But one should also listen at least a little to
what Mother says.

00:30:35.195 --> 00:30:39.537
It doesn't hurt to listen a little. I am telling
you for your good.

00:30:40.579 --> 00:30:45.920
Right now everyone is saying, "Well, just tell,
why did such a huge cyclone wreak havoc in India?"

00:30:46.270 --> 00:30:50.003
If you watch My tape, I recently went to Guntur.
Ask Modi, he went there too.

00:30:50.995 --> 00:30:55.953
I told everyone there, "You're planting these
tobacco plants all over the village."

00:30:56.128 --> 00:31:00.420
"You've planted tobacco over the entire area
and you don't plant anything else,"

00:31:00.778 --> 00:31:06.262
"One day here—the moon and the sun might forgive you
once, but this ocean will devour you, mark My words."

00:31:06.945 --> 00:31:09.170
"There will be havoc," I said that word there.

00:31:09.470 --> 00:31:13.720
I said, "Stop this; you are committing a grave mistake."

00:31:14.612 --> 00:31:19.095
And secondly, I told them, "The black magic
that you are practicing here..."

00:31:19.153 --> 00:31:23.212
- All the poor people are practicing black magic
there - a lot of black magic was prevalent there.

00:31:23.562 --> 00:31:29.012
And there was so much money now because of
that tobacco, that people were going crazy.

00:31:29.429 --> 00:31:34.178
And they had taken to filthy, nasty 'gurus' there;
they had accepted dirty women as their gurus.

00:31:34.870 --> 00:31:38.003
I said, "There will be havoc in this country,
you leave it;"

00:31:38.128 --> 00:31:41.586
So everyone got angry with Me, no one even
wrote a letter to Me.

00:31:42.528 --> 00:31:46.670
And today see, the same thing has happened which I
had said earlier; I had given many warnings.

00:31:46.720 --> 00:31:48.620
I said that, "This sea will devour you."

00:31:51.312 --> 00:31:55.212
So, everyone felt really bad that "Mataji has
turned against our industry itself."

00:31:55.354 --> 00:31:59.304
And otherwise too, their exports to the UK have
stopped; you should know that too.

00:31:59.404 --> 00:32:01.295
It has been completely stopped.

00:32:02.612 --> 00:32:08.696
You are likely aware that people in the UK no
longer take tobacco from our country—they have
put an end to that.

00:32:12.438 --> 00:32:16.838
If a demoness offers money, should one really
accept it and place it on one's head?

00:32:17.971 --> 00:32:22.013
If someone can earn money by being a prostitute,
should she do that?

00:32:23.596 --> 00:32:26.455
If money is everything then take the money.

00:32:27.780 --> 00:32:33.863
There are many such things. However, God
is not displeased with this.

00:32:34.871 --> 00:32:37.871
It is not God's anger; I explained this to
these people yesterday as well.

00:32:38.313 --> 00:32:43.454
God does not get angry with you; it is you who run
away from God—you step out from under His
sheltering care.

00:32:44.412 --> 00:32:48.879
The deities that you have within yourself – you know there
are deities on every chakra – they go to sleep.

00:32:49.871 --> 00:32:52.012
And you departed from the Kingdom of God.

00:32:52.487 --> 00:32:56.920
The protection over you has ended and you
are finished, what is God's fault in that?

00:32:56.987 --> 00:33:02.762
You yourself accepted the loss. When you
choose loss, you incur loss.

00:33:05.195 --> 00:33:07.237
There is no fault of God in this.

00:33:08.379 --> 00:33:13.279
The fault is yours that you abandoned God
and accepted loss.

00:33:16.379 --> 00:33:20.571
It's too late today because I

00:33:20.754 --> 00:33:24.479
have been put to a big test today.

00:33:28.054 --> 00:33:31.546
I faced a major test today; Today I

00:33:32.304 --> 00:33:37.063
really wanted to meet everyone, come soon,
and get things done fast.

00:33:37.905 --> 00:33:40.329
And Mr. Modi's car also failed and

00:33:40.437 --> 00:33:43.220
and you all stayed here too, and everyone was
put to a major test.

00:33:43.370 --> 00:33:45.037
But it was fun too.

00:33:45.412 --> 00:33:48.737
You know, after a brief pause and a period of
separation, when the reunion finally happens,

00:33:48.987 --> 00:33:53.904
so, it becomes somewhat miraculous; it takes
on a poetic quality,

00:33:54.671 --> 00:33:58.429
that "We kept waiting, and then suddenly, Mataji arrived,"

00:33:58.496 --> 00:34:02.971
and how overjoyed we became—because during waiting your..."

00:34:05.338 --> 00:34:08.979
depth increases. Because of that depth you
can fill yourself up.

00:34:11.471 --> 00:34:17.696
As long as I am in India, and as long as I am
in Bombay, you all come to every program.

00:34:18.313 --> 00:34:21.879
Although you know that I have come here with
My husband on vacation,

00:34:22.196 --> 00:34:26.871
and he was saying, "I took only one holiday in my life,
and even in that You don't stay with me.

00:34:27.513 --> 00:34:32.571
I am running the world too, and this little world
I am running too.

00:34:32.679 --> 00:34:35.496
Because I want you people also not to leave
your world.

00:34:35.913 --> 00:34:40.921
Its veil is also made in it.

00:34:41.738 --> 00:34:47.479
But as long as I am here, whenever there is a
program, you must come, and I will certainly
come too.

00:34:49.996 --> 00:34:56.229
The second thing is that there are such useless
people in the world too -

00:34:56.354 --> 00:35:00.404
"Mataji has come—Mataji, my sister's father's so-and-so..."

00:35:00.570 --> 00:35:04.937
"(UNCLEAR) he is my real relative" - there is
nothing in all this.

00:35:06.595 --> 00:35:11.612
Don't set out to do a favor to anyone. Instead,
say, "You first get your realization." This
is the greatest task.

00:35:11.970 --> 00:35:17.004
Illnesses and ailments can be cured in hospitals too.
First, get realization; let everyone's Spirit be awakened.

00:35:21.587 --> 00:35:25.379
The day everyone realizes this...

00:35:25.787 --> 00:35:29.579
that this is the most important thing, that very day

00:35:29.712 --> 00:35:32.996
you understand that Sahaja Yoga will reach a
very high pedestal.
